TBD — the team has not yet chosen a license.

Candidates to discuss:
- MIT — permissive, industry-friendly.
- Apache-2.0 — permissive + explicit patent grant (useful because robotics hardware integration may involve patented sensors/SDKs).
- CC-BY-4.0 — for documentation and lit-review only (not code).
- BSD-3-Clause — another permissive option.

Once chosen, replace this file with the license text. If different licenses apply to code vs. data vs. docs, note that here.
